# Effective container environment of the compute-lane arm L boot (format-retest, rank 0), image
# tensorfold-dsv41-imr:r-3a429d6f122d, engine 3a429d6f1 (= recipe pin 07106059c, same tree). Read from the boot's
# docker inspect snapshot. Removed: the CUDA base image's own variables and every credential name (values never kept).
# Placeholders replace the link address and RDMA device names. Arm P differs only in TF_DSV41_COMPUTE_LANE=0, arm D is
# P's engine with the tool declared, and rank 1 differs only in TF_TP_RANK=1. Names this engine does not read
# (GLM53_TF_ROCE_*, TF_DSV41_PLAN_*, TF_DSV41_DRAIN_S, TF_DSV41_SSE_KEEPALIVE_S, TF_DSV41_REQUEST_LOG, TF_DSV41_INDEX_KV,
# TF_DSV41_DISCONNECT) were passed by the bench launcher and have no effect.
GLM53_TF_ROCE_FAST=1
GLM53_TF_ROCE_MAX_KB=1024
NCCL_CUMEM_ENABLE=0
NCCL_CUMEM_HOST_ENABLE=0
NCCL_IB_HCA=<cabled-RDMA-devices>
NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME=<link-interface>
TENSORFOLD_REQUEST_LOG=/state/requests.jsonl
TF_COMM_BACKEND=roce
TF_DRAIN_S=20
TF_DSV41_ACCEPT_LOG=/state/acclog.jsonl
TF_DSV41_ASSETS=/assets
TF_DSV41_BIAS_VL=/model
TF_DSV41_BRANCHES=1
TF_DSV41_BRANCHES_PRIO=side
TF_DSV41_CALIB=zig
TF_DSV41_CALIB_DIR=/state/calib-zig
TF_DSV41_CODE_ACCEPT=0
TF_DSV41_COMPUTE_LANE=1
